      "mathTerms": [
        "Lighting is de-preexposed in the integrate pass (VolumeTraceRadiance * View.OneOverPreExposure, LumenTranslucencyVolumeLighting.usf:261) before the SH projection, so this volume is in physical radiance units, unlike VolumeTraceRadiance.",
        "The shader writes a float4(Ambient,0) into a 3-channel R11G11B10 texture: the alpha 0 is discarded by the format and is not stored.",
        "The two-band SH uses basis {1, y, z, x} with signs (0.282095, -0.488603*y, +0.488603*z, -0.488603*x) (SHCommon.ush:221-229)."
      ],
